  "email_html_body": "\n    <div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, 'PingFang TC', 'Microsoft JhengHei', sans-serif; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto; color: #1f2937;\">\n      <h1 style=\"color: #007bff; text-align:center; font-size: 24px;\">GitHub 開源科技報告</h1>\n      <p style=\"text-align:center; color:#666; margin-bottom: 30px;\">日期: 2026-10-17</p>\n    \n      <h2 style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb; padding-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 32px;\">寫程式</h2>\n        \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">public-apis</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Python | Star: 489,777</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">該專案彙整了大量的免費 API 列表，涵蓋多種應用場景，是開發者尋找整合服務或學習新技術的重要資源，能有效提升開發效率。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/public-apis/public-apis\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/public-apis\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">freeCodeCamp</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: TypeScript | Star: 457,320</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">freeCodeCamp 提供免費的開源程式碼庫和課程，讓使用者能學習數學、程式設計和電腦科學，是程式初學者與進階學習者自我提升的寶貴平台。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/freeCodeCamp/freeCodeCamp\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/freeCodeCamp\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">free-programming-books</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Python | Star: 399,359</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">此專案匯集了大量免費的程式設計書籍，涵蓋各種程式語言與技術，對於希望透過閱讀提升技能的開發者來說是不可多得的學習寶庫。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/EbookFoundation/free-programming-books\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/free-programming-books\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">developer-roadmap</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: TypeScript | Star: 369,698</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">此專案提供互動式的開發者職涯路線圖與教育內容，協助開發者規劃學習路徑並提升專業技能，是程式設計師成長與學習新技術的實用指南。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/nilbuild/developer-roadmap\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/developer-roadmap\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">awesome-python</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Python | Star: 328,222</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">Awesome Python 是一個精選的 Python 框架、函式庫和工具列表，旨在幫助開發者快速找到解決特定問題的最佳工具，是 Python 開發者不可或缺的參考指南。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/vinta/awesome-python\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/awesome-python\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">awesome-selfhosted</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Unknown | Star: 327,695</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">這個專案整理了大量可自行架設的免費網路服務與網頁應用程式，讓使用者能在自己的伺服器上部署各種解決方案，對於重視隱私或希望自主控制服務的個人及團隊極具價值。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/awesome-selfhosted/awesome-selfhosted\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/awesome-selfhosted\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">project-based-learning</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Python | Star: 287,070</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">該專案收集了大量以專案為基礎的教學資源，幫助學習者透過實作來掌握程式設計技能，是提升程式能力和積累實戰經驗的絕佳途徑。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/practical-tutorials/project-based-learning\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/project-based-learning\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">d2r-mobile</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: C | Star: 3,705</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">該專案提供《暗黑破壞神 II：獄火重生》的開源 iOS / macOS 相容層，讓玩家能在行動裝置與 Mac 上原生運行遊戲，為廣大遊戲愛好者帶來全新的遊玩體驗。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/jhaizhou-ops/d2r-mobile\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/d2r-mobile\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">CCBaga</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Rust | Star: 2,569</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">由於缺乏詳細描述，該專案的核心功能與應用場景暫不清楚，但推測為一個程式開發相關的項目，值得進一步探索其潛在價值。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/liseami/CCBaga\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/CCBaga\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">everything</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: JavaScript | Star: 2,048</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">HeyPuter 的目標是從頭開始重建並開源全球軟體，這是一個極具雄心的專案，旨在打造一個全新的軟體生態系，對於開源社群和軟體創新具有深遠意義。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/HeyPuter/everything\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/everything\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">BRUTAL</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: C# | Star: 1,790</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">BRUTAL 是一個開源的 C# 遊戲開發框架，提供原生 API 和 Vulkan 的直接存取，讓開發者能高效地建立遊戲或自定義遊戲引擎，對於追求高性能和靈活性的遊戲開發者來說是一個強大工具。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/ahwootech/BRUTAL\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/BRUTAL\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">solid-glass</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: TypeScript | Star: 1,688</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">Solid Glass 是一個專為 AI 應用設計的設計系統，其美學理念結合了材質、物理、觸覺與技術感，能協助開發者快速且一致地構建具備優良使用者體驗的 AI 產品。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/deeplethe/solid-glass\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/solid-glass\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">uncharted_pc</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: C++ | Star: 1,254</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">該專案實現了《秘境探險：奈森德瑞克合輯》在 Windows 上的原生運行，讓 PC 玩家也能體驗這款經典遊戲，展現了社群在遊戲移植與相容性方面的技術實力。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Supermedo/uncharted_pc\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/uncharted_pc\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <h2 style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb; padding-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 32px;\">AI Skill</h2>\n        \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">skills</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Shell | Star: 295,080</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">此專案匯集了為工程師設計的實用技能，內容直接來自於作者的代理程式目錄，對於希望提升自身或 AI 代理程式執行特定任務能力的開發者來說，提供了寶貴的參考與實作範例。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/mattpocock/skills\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Skill/skills\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">qwen21-nsfw-pose-skill</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Python | Star: 2,632</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">Qwen-Image 2.1 NSFW/姿势出图 skill 提供作者級提示詞配方和姿態控制功能，專為生成特定風格圖像設計，能強化其他 AI 模型或代理在圖像創作上的表現。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Arekejoker/qwen21-nsfw-pose-skill\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Skill/qwen21-nsfw-pose-skill\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">handwired</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: TypeScript | Star: 1,674</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">Handwired 能夠將普通的 JavaScript 程式碼轉化為神經網路，為前端開發者提供了在既有技能基礎上探索 AI 模型的創新方式，值得關注其在網頁智能應用上的潛力。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/chenglou/handwired\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Skill/handwired\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">git-ai</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Go | Star: 1,135</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">Git AI 是一個專為 AI 代理設計的 Git 版本控制系統，能幫助 AI 代理有效管理其程式碼和數據，對於開發和部署協作型 AI 專案具有重要意義。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/feder-cr/git-ai\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Skill/git-ai\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <h2 style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb; padding-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 32px;\">AI Agent</h2>\n        \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; 